        "text": {
            "description_html": "<b>Bommer 7890-603, Top Door Pivot Hinge</b>\r\n<p>\r\nTop pivot assembly for use with <a href=\"/products/horizontal-floor-spring-hinge-set-with-hold-open-bommer-7811\"><b>Bommer 7811</b></a>, <a href=\"/products/horizontal-floor-spring-hinge-set-bommer-7813\"><b>Bommer 7813</b></a> and <a href=\"/products/heavy-duty-floor-spring-hinge-set-bommer-7813hd\"><b>Bommer 7813HD</b></a> Horizontal Spring Hinges. This non-load bearing door pivot is normally installed on the doors top in conjunction with a load bearing floor pivot assembly. \r\n</p>\r\n<p>\r\n<b>Specifications</b> for Bommer 7890-603 Top Door Pivot\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>Mounting Plate Length: 2-1/8\"</li>\r\n<li>Mounting Plate Width: 7/8\"</li>\r\n<li>Mounting Holes: 1-1/2\" Center to Center, Both Plates</li>\r\n<li>Pivot Pin Length: 5/8\" </li>\r\n<li>Pivot Pin Diameter: .435\" </li>\r\n<li>Material: Steel</li>\r\n<li>Bushing Material: Nylon</li>\r\n<li>Finish: Zinc Plated</li>\r\n<li>Packaged with mounting screws.</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</p>\r\n<p><b>*Sold Individually. </b>\r\n</p>\r\n<p>\r\n<br><br>\r\n<b>** This item is Discontinued. Use <a href=\"/products/top-pivot-for-deltana-dash95-floor-spring-hinge\">Deltana DASH95TP Top Door Pivot Hinge</a></b>\r\n<br><br>\r\n</p>",
